<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Ouch.</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">February 27. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kttalk.png" width="458" height="40"></p>
<p align="left">I guess, I failed...</p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/KingTormax.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/KingTormaxsmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/195.jpg" width="312" height="13"></p>
<p align="center">Woops.</p>
<p align="left">Guess I'm not a hero of Kael Drakkel no more :( Oh well.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/KTloot.jpg" width="120" height="209"></p>
<p align="center">Thank ya King.</p>
<p align="center">Grats Tiersett on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/AxeoftheKromzekKings.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">Senya on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/KingTormaxHead.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">Korisa on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/HsagrasTalisman.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">Aandawen on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/RingofLightning.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">Lilsweetdream on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/WhiteDragonscaleSash.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">and Orduhre on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/CrownoftheKromzekKings.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="left">Vindi took it shortly after, of course. Grats Gruz on Boots,
Nemster on ST KEY!<p align="left">And now, to what you have all been waiting
for. I present to you, Darksphere's new biatch:<p align="center"><b><font size="6">GRUMMUS!</font></b><p align="left">The
most challenging encounter DS have had to date, and we passed it, we friggin
passed it! 56 of us is what it took, I haven't heard it done with fewer on
Karana!!! Grats Darksphere!<p align="left">Now of course I died right after I
got my loot shot, so thats all I can show ya this time. You will have to wait
for more screenshots of the action. Then again, I can't go around showing my
leet tactics now can I :P<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Grummusloot.jpg" width="120" height="193"><p align="center">pwned!<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/RingofthePoxBearer.jpg" width="400" height="215"><p align="left">Grats
Darksphere on this awesome kill! We will be back for more!<p align="left"><b>Quotes!</b><p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/193.jpg" width="336" height="26"><p align="left">Yeah....<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/194.jpg" width="456" height="26"><p align="left">I
do love loot distribution :P<p align="left">Thank you VI for the new feature.<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/196.jpg" width="281" height="25"><p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">The Itraer Vius.</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">February 24. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Is a joke :P Oh wait, all perma rooted mobs are. We came,
cleared his guards in 2 pulls, wiped cause of some agro issues, rezzed right
under his nose, I yelled a bit, clarified strats and we went back in for a
flawless kill. One brave Halas warrior fell, so, I blame the clerics :P If a guy
in a kilt dies, something went wrong /nod.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/187.jpg" width="408" height="39"></p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/TheIV.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/TheIVsmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center">Perfect.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/TheIVloot.jpg" width="119" height="201"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Zindras on Crown, Myself on FT2 range stone.</p>
<p align="left">It's no secret we've spent a lot of time in the Bastion of
Thunder. We finally got our leet strats down, and now they are just going down
down down. Tower bosses of course :P Of course VI needs to realize that they
actually should drop loot, instead of some really annoying container that you
really only need one of to get a raid in with, and a spectral parchment that you
can get 5 of in a good exp session. /sigh. Anyways, we know em, we hit em and we
will drain them for all they are worth!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/EindrideIcestorm.jpg" width="512" height="384"></p>
<p align="center">He is the pain. But now he is dead and we got phat lewts :P</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Eindrideloot.jpg" width="120" height="157"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Vikos on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/GreatBladeofStorms.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="center">Dlandridel on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/OrnateBPmold.jpg" width="400" height="215"></p>
<p align="left">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quotes</b></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/189.jpg" width="268" height="28"></p>
<p align="left">Vikos the harry potter discovers shielding.</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/190.jpg" width="266" height="131"></p>
<p align="left">Then of course he shields after the mob is dead...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/191.jpg" width="359" height="25"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/192.jpg" width="283" height="14"></p>
<p align="left">....</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/188.jpg" width="316" height="13"></p>
<p align="left">omg. so leet. yes.</p>
<p align="left">Maybe I will include some quotes from other ppl next time. :D</p>
<p align="left">Vikos we lubs you!</p>


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">It's like... they are calling for us to come
kill them!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">February 18. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">&quot;This sort of things used to be civilized. You hit a guy,
he whack you, done. But with Benedict..... he better not know you're involved!
Not know your names or think you're dead, cause he'll kill ya, and then go to
work on ya!&quot;</p>
<p align="left">I do love that movie. And I think that quote pretty much
describes Darksphere's killing spree lately :P</p>
<p align="left">We started with Keeper 2 weeks ago, innocent, she is on
rotation, we were up, she saw it coming.&nbsp;</p>
<p align="left">Then it was poor Klandicar's fault. Standing around minding his
own business, too lasy to see invis. Boom, dead. 2 First brood dragons in a
couple of days.</p>
<p align="left">The Big Daddy spawned, Lord Yelinak himself, the one sleeper
even couldn't kill on karana :P (SoE's scripting is flawless). Very fun fight,
flawless first time run for us, only 2 deaths. pwned.</p>
<p align="left">Zlandicar popped a few days ago, and luckily our late night crew
was on. THAT kill wasn't civilized at all :P poor zland. Didn't even get 30 mins
to live =/</p>
<p align="left">Then last night, after our 2309412th dain kill and 200th shawl
war, we decided to go hang in ToV for the rest of the night. And what do you
know, our old pain in the arse friend Sontalak was waiting for us, right there
at the entrance. Crossing WW with a CoV kos guild was harder than to take out
Sontalak :D we <b>pwned </b>him so hard. Flawless killing. First try, first
kill... excellent. Of course Vikos had to add some drama into it, by going LD
seconds before we engaged :P</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/182.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">I'm sure that was the cause of his LD...</p>
<p align="left">Result of the last 10 days of killing : 5 ST keys, all 5 First
Brood dwaguns DEAD!&nbsp;<br>
Grats Dlandridel, Vikos, Orduhre, Kangazcon and Fabbas on ST key!</p>
<p align="left">Grats Darksphere! ST here we come!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/184.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">(Meni's way of saying we rule?)</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Sontalaksmall.jpg"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/186.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">So L33T, I agree Dlan.<br>
Bwahahahaahaha</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Sontloot.jpg" align="top"><img border="0" src="Kills/Zlandloot2.jpg" align="top"></p>
<p align="center">Grats to the various winners! :P</p>
<p align="left">We also finally managed to take down our first tower boss in BoT
:P 30 of us went in, and we emerged victorious! And what can I say? VI, fix this
ghey lewt, k tnx, kikoo.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/brunjyloot.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Fun kill, that's about it :P</p>
<p align="left">It seems however, that raiding this much takes our members away
from RL, and then this happens...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/185.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">sad...</p>
<p align="left">Hmm, guess it goes like this instead: So Chanter -&gt; Warrior
-&gt; Bard</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/183.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">pwned!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">February 15. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">The Lord of Dwaguns, The Lord of all the smelly mofos we so
enjoy to take down is, well... DEAD! Lord Yelinak himself, bites the dust! We
CoHed in, cleared his lair in no time, went in for the kill, and took him out in
our first shot ever, with only 2 deaths! We totally pwned him!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Yelinak.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">One dead Yelinak!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Yeliloot.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Dlandridel on his head, Vikos on the ST talisman,
Trekkie Ord on the Robe, Bigduke on Whip, Chey on Sword and Taliara on Mace!</p>
<p align="center">NToV, here we come!</p>
<p align="left">Trak, the lesser dwagun back there in good oll seb, well, he
took another dirt nap to our late night crew - and go figure, Singing Steel BP
:P Cloak of piety too though, that was nice for a change.&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Trakloot3.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Vindi and Dain took several more dirt naps too - those BP's and
belts still are waayy nice ;) Grats too all the winners there, we will keep on
hitting them till we got all we need from them :P</p>
<p align="left">And without any further comments, Klandicar fell to us again
last night! Grats Kangazcon the Ogre on ST Key and Guldarm on a nice peerless
BP!</p>
<p align="left">Grats guys! One hell of a night!</p>


<p align="left">&nbsp;


<p align="left"><b><font size="3">Oh, Hi there!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">February 10. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="left">Yea yea yea, here is your update! :P So... what have Darksphere
been up to? Well... Flags! zzz Farming! zzz x2! Think at this time we got all
our members PoS/PoV flagged (which is also now a requirement for new members to
have), close to 90% BoT flagged as well as most of us flagged for PoNb and PoI
factory.</p>
<p align="left">Killed Dain Dorfmaster 2039 times, Vindi 2 times less than Dain,
various PoP mobs and bla bla bla.</p>
<p align="left">So, following one of our brave tanks, lets move on with the
update!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/171.jpg"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Vikosassling.jpg"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/172.jpg"><br>
Uh... right.</p>
<p align="center">Dead Dragons, we like those! So here is another!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Xanamech.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">That only took us like 3 totally FUBAR'ed gnome pathing runs.
Fix this SoE, k tnx, kikoo!</p>
<p align="center">And of course, it only dropped caster stuff!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Xanaloot.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Saddari on the Staff, Ord Trekkie Gnome on the Force
Field Generator</p>
<p align="center">Oh yea, we also nailed Keeper again. Always a fun fight,
easier and easier.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Lendiloot2.jpg"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Hadees on BP, Fabbas on Mace, Bigduke on Ring and
Dlandridel on ST talisman!</p>
<p align="left">Ok, I suck at this update, so lets on to the quotes before I say
something stupid! *cough*</p>
<p align="left"><b>Quotes of the month!</b></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/174.jpg"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/173.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Braindead chanter starting a warrior. Isn't that how it all
begins? :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/175.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">More proof :P Warriors aren't smart :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/176.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">What's worse than a ass loving rogue? An ass loving rogue that
wants to dual box rogues! /puke :p</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/177.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Never happened to me *cough*</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/178.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">SoE customer service is the best!</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/179.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">Another warrior comes out as a ranjar. So Chanter -&gt; Warrior
-&gt; Ranger?</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/180.jpg"></p>
<p align="left">And yea, clerics is at the end of that list...</p>
<p align="left">And finally, Dlandridel's secret to fighting Grummus!!</p>


<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/181.jpg">


<p align="left">See ya in a month! :D


